    "web_f210_rev_q8": "Exactly the kind of help I need 👍👍👍",
    "web_f210_rev_q7": "Top app, exactly what I needed to manage my digestion",
    "web_f210_rev_q6": "Finally an AI tool for people with gastrointestinal challenges",
    "web_f210_rev_q5": "Living with a FODMAP diet is tough enough — this app actually makes it manageable. Great for beginners and experienced users alike. Highly recommended tool!",
    "web_f210_rev_q4": "I don't know much about nutrition, but this app has made it so much easier to control what I can eat. I just scan the product in the store and get an answer right away. I've been using it almost every day since I downloaded it.",
    "web_f210_rev_q3": "The best app for IBS I've come across. Easy to understand and easy to find my way around in everyday life. Highly recommended! :)",
