    "web_f80_f_toalett_h": "Toilet map",
    "web_f80_f_toalett_p": "Find toilets nearby, filter by free, wheelchair access, changing table and open now, and save your favorites. Toilet data from OpenStreetMap.",
    "web_f80_f_rapport_h": "Report for your doctor",
