    "web_f80_lenke_rapport": "See the example report",
    "web_f80_cam7h": "🥗 Hot and cold buffets",
    "web_f80_cam7p": "Take one photo of the whole buffet table. The AI finds the dishes and shows which are low, moderate and high in FODMAP, so you get the full picture fast.",
    "web_f80_cam8h": "🍽️ Log what you ate",
    "web_f80_cam8p": "Tap “Log as eaten” once you've eaten what you scanned. You choose the portion afterwards, and the meal goes straight into your diary.",
    "web_f80_cam9h": "🗂️ My scans",
    "web_f80_cam9p": "All your scans are gathered in one place, with search. Filter by dish, menu, buffet, fridge or barcode, and open an earlier result again.",
    "web_f80_ch7h": "💡 Suggestions for you",
    "web_f80_ch7p": "The chat suggests questions based on your scans and meals, such as low-FODMAP alternatives to something you've scanned or a recipe for something you've eaten.",
    "web_f80_ch8h": "🙋 Knows you from the start",
    "web_f80_ch8p": "The answers you give when you start using the app are used as background in the chat, so you don't have to repeat yourself. You can change them anytime.",
    "web_f80_ch9h": "🕒 Deleted after 24 hours",
    "web_f80_ch9p": "Messages stay in the chat for 24 hours and are then deleted automatically.",
    "web_f80_dag_tag": "✦ Diary and overview",
    "web_f80_dag_title": "Log day to day, see your <em>patterns</em>",
    "web_f80_dag_sub": "Keep a diary of symptoms, bathroom visits and meals. FODMAPP gathers what you log into charts, a calendar and an overview of what comes up most often.",
    "web_f80_logg_merke": "Logging",
    "web_f80_logg_h": "Done in a couple of minutes",
